                         Trap
---------------------------------------------------------------------

Conceal a pressure trap in the room. It springs when a valid non-Thief
threat leaves or handles it. It also springs on a stationary NPC once
that NPC begins fighting the setter in the trapped room.

Before combat, use 'lace <poison> into trap' to spend one prepared dose
and add its normal poison effect to the trap strike. Traps expire after
five minutes and are removed with 'disarm trap'.

  GLVL: 15
  Syntax: trap
